{
  "item": "BeamKnight01",
  "mu_name": "Beam Knight",
  "mu_name_from": "MuMain _enum.h MONSTER_BEAM_KNIGHT (61), drawn as MONSTER_MODEL_BEAM_KNIGHT = 44 (_enum.h:4194), so Monster45.bmd -- the Death Beam Knight (63) wears the same body. OpenMU Version095d Maps/Tarkan.cs:391 names breed 61 'Beam Knight'. docs/tarkan-port.md.",
  "world": "tarkan",
  "object_type": 61,
  "monster": {
    "model_index": 44,
    "scale": 1.5
  },
  "monster_from": "ZzzCharacter.cpp:13712-13729, CreateMonster, case MONSTER_BEAM_KNIGHT: Scale = 1.5f, no weapon. Two BITMAP_JOINT_ENERGY eye trails (CreateMonster) and MU's sand smoke on its walk and death (MonsterMoveSandSmoke/MonsterDieSandSmoke) are not drawn yet, as the Mutant's and the Bloody Wolf's are not. Its attack's six sparks off the hands (:2152-2160) and MODEL_SKILL_INFERNO (:1838-1846) are not drawn; its Energy Ball (attack_skill 17) is the realm's.",
  "profile": "monster",
  "rig_from": "Exported with --actions=all, 7 actions, 88 bones. BoneHead 6 (ZzzOpenData.cpp:3704-3709). Dies at 0.3 (:2637-2639): actions.json's action_overrides. Its LinkBones 55 (Box03) and 70 (Box27) carry nothing.",
  "sheets": {
    "devil": "beamknight_devil.png",
    "devilhair": "beamknight_devilhair.png",
    "devilwing": "beamknight_devilwing.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Data/Monster's devil.OZJ (256 square, the body, 968 triangles), devilhair.OZT (32 square, the mane, its alpha a mask, 68) and devilwing.OZJ (256x128, the bat wings, 216), under a beamknight_ prefix.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "devil": "skin",
    "devilhair": "hair",
    "devilwing": "leather"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "Read off the art: devil is a grey-green scaled hide with a single eye, ribbed horns, a fur strip and violet flesh -- skin; devilhair a dark mane; devilwing a grey membrane on bone with violet runes -- leather, as the Valkyrie's fins.",
  "soft_alpha": [
    "hair"
  ],
  "soft_alpha_from": "devilhair.OZT is drawn tested and blended (EnableAlphaTest, ZzzOpenglUtil.cpp:366-393), as the Bloody Wolf's mane.",
  "sounds_from": "ZzzOpenData.cpp:3704-3709: SetMonsterSound(..., 154, 154, 155, 155, 156): death1 to move, death_attack1 to attack, death_die to die. Wired as beamknight_* in sounds.json.",
